ABOUT THIS PROJECT

KI5 General Fixes patches faults that KI5's vehicle mods share, rather than one
vehicle at a time. Those vehicles are built from a common template, so a fault in
the template reaches every car built on it. This targets that shared surface.

It ships no files from any of them. Every fix is written from scratch against
what those mods actually load, and stands down when the thing it targets is not
present.


THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS

Nothing from another mod is bundled here. This section exists so that stays true
and visible: if a fix ever has to carry a file it did not write, it is listed
here before it ships, with the terms it ships under and what was taken.

The mods this one is written against are named below. Each remains the property
of its author. None of them is redistributed, in whole or in part.

  KI5's vehicles
    By KI5, also known as bikinihorst. Steam Workshop, many items.

    Bundled: nothing.

    These are what the fixes are for. Their scripts and lua are read to work out
    what the shared template does and where it goes wrong, the same way a bug
    report is read. Nothing is copied out of them.

  that DAMN Library
    From "that DAMN Library", Steam Workshop 3171167894, by KI5.

    Bundled: nothing. It is a hard dependency, required by every KI5 vehicle
    already, so a player running any of them has it.

    Where a fix hooks something DAMN provides, it registers through the library's
    own entry points rather than replacing its files.

  KI5 Mini-fixes
    From "KI5 Mini-fixes", Steam Workshop 3740300378, by Пупсич.

    Bundled: nothing.

    It covers some of the same ground. Anything it already fixes is left to it,
    and where both are installed this one gets out of the way rather than
    fighting over the same call.

  Specific Loot (KI5)
    From "Specific Loot (KI5)", Steam Workshop 3457132019, by Пупсич.

    Bundled: nothing. Read only, to know what already writes into KI5 vehicle
    loot so nothing here writes over it.

  Yet Another PZ Library
    From "Yet Another PZ Library", Steam Workshop 3624971238, by Пупсич.

    Bundled: nothing, and not a dependency. Read only, as what Specific Loot
    sits on.


LOCAL REFERENCE MATERIAL

The unpacked source of every mod above is kept under other-mods/ so fixes can be
written against what the game really loads. It is other people's work under other
people's terms and is not published: the folder is in .gitignore and is excluded
from the Workshop upload. Anyone building this repository supplies their own copy
by subscribing to those mods.


